    skos:changeNote "0.2.0 (2026-10-21): Restructured to the operational areas and the naming standard (D26, D27): titled 'Domain Legal Vocabulary', '… Taxonomy', '… Ontology' and '… Shapes'; moved from Commercial Operations to Business Operations. It now owns the client service agreement, commercial agreement and clause (from Commercial Operations) and the contract management steps, agreement terms and agreement statuses (from Pricing and contracts). It cites Commercial Operations primitives (D27) but imports only the core and the Business Operations ontology. Built by build_domains.py from spec_legal.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0)."@en ,
        "0.1.0 (2026-10-20): first release. Built by build_domains.py from spec_legal.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0)."@en ,
